@REIGN.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5012

GET {{REIGN.API_HostAddress}}/api/integrations/status
Accept: application/json

### Internal SMS simulator (JSON, Development only)
POST {{REIGN.API_HostAddress}}/api/sms/incoming
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "3605550100",
  "message": "Book a QV tomorrow at 2 pm"
}

### Owner human-override outbound SMS
POST {{REIGN.API_HostAddress}}/api/messages/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+13605550100",
  "body": "This is Miss Reign. I'll take this conversation from here."
}

### Resume assistant auto-replies
POST {{REIGN.API_HostAddress}}/api/messages/resume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+13605550100",
  "body": ""
}

### Twilio inbound webhook (requires valid X-Twilio-Signature)
POST {{REIGN.API_HostAddress}}/api/sms/incoming
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

From=%2B15555550123&To=%2B15555550100&Body=Hello&MessageSid=SM123

### Twilio inbound webhook alias
POST {{REIGN.API_HostAddress}}/api/sms/webhooks/twilio
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

From=%2B15555550123&To=%2B15555550100&Body=Hello&MessageSid=SM123

### Vonage inbound webhook (requires signed JWT when RequireSignedWebhooks=true)
POST {{REIGN.API_HostAddress}}/api/sms/webhooks/vonage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "15555550123",
  "to": "15555550100",
  "text": "Hello"
}

### Google Calendar OAuth start
GET {{REIGN.API_HostAddress}}/api/integrations/google/authorize
